    passiveDescription: "\U0001F4AB <b>Hyper-projection</b>: Grants <b><color=#714>\u26D3
      combo</color></b> to me.\n"
    passiveBuffDescriptions: "I have acquired <b><color=#714>\u26D3 combo</color></b>
      from my passive <b></b>\n"
    actionsDescription: "\U0001F3AF Ranged attack and gains the <b><color=#900>attack</color></b>
      value from <b><color=#222> the <b>last ally who attacked</b> during this round</color></b>
      as <b><color=#900>attack</color></b> for this attack, gains the <b><color=#222>hit
      effects</color></b> from the subtypes of <b><color=#222> the <b>last ally who
      attacked</b> during this round</color></b> if  the <b>last ally who attacked</b>
      during this round is  on the board.\nOpponent's next attacking unit makes them
      perform a \u2694\uFE0F Melee attack which deals <b><color=#222>+5</color></b>
      <b><color=#900>damage</color></b> to myself as an extra attack.\nMy attack
      gains the <b><color=#900>attack</color></b> value from <b><color=#222> the
      <b>last ally who attacked</b> during this round</color></b> as <b><color=#900>attack</color></b>
      for this attack and  if I'm next to the <b>last ally who performed an action</b>
      during this roundI repeat the last performed action by an ally <i>(attack effects
      are ignored if action is not offensive)</i>.\n"
